# memory/decisions.md is an append-only prose log full of bare
# underscore_identifiers (migration_0003, snake_case fields, etc.) in
# plain text, not inside code spans. Prettier's markdown emphasis
# normalization repeatedly mangled these into `migration*0003` /
# `_word_` on every commit that touched the file — corrupting past
# entries as a side effect of unrelated appends. See memory/decisions.md
# 2026-07-27 "CI_DOGFOOD_AGENTVISTA_*" entry, corrupted and fixed twice
# before this exclusion was added.
memory/decisions.md
